WEBVTT

00:03:29.997 --> 00:03:31.040
But most importantly,

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:35.878
because cash is such a center
of energy and decision-making

00:03:35.878 --> 00:03:37.838
for these families,

00:03:37.838 --> 00:03:40.341
through our apprenticeship program,

00:03:40.341 --> 00:03:41.926
we literally pay them to learn.

00:03:43.761 --> 00:03:46.472
So not only do they get to earn a wage

00:03:46.472 --> 00:03:49.433
and are exposed to real-world work,

00:03:49.433 --> 00:03:52.103
but now they also have
that first line on the resume.

00:03:52.311 --> 00:03:54.480
The one that’s so hard to get

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.900
and the one that builds confidence
in the rest of the world

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.069
that you might know
what you’re talking about.